{"entries":[{"id":"anthropic-components-of-agent-memory","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"The components of agent memory","titleZh":"智能体记忆的组成部分","published":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1793923200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-components-of-agent-memory/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/1e7931f55315a7b4.webp","summary":"Effective agent memory comes from tagging salient events during work and later 'dreaming' over logs to correct errors and build representations, while indiscriminate note-taking bloats and degrades memory.","summaryZh":"有效的智能体记忆来自工作中标记显著事件、事后通过“做梦”反思日志以纠错并构建表征，而无差别记录会导致记忆臃肿并降低性能。"},{"id":"anthropic-s1-2026","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Anthropic, PBC — Form S-1 Registration Statement (IPO Prospectus)","titleZh":"Anthropic, PBC —S-1 注册声明（IPO 招股说明书）","published":"2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1792972800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-s1-2026/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic files for IPO, citing Claude's rapid enterprise adoption and a mission-driven, safety-focused approach to capturing a multi-trillion-dollar AI opportunity.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 提交 IPO 申请，强调 Claude 在企业市场的快速普及，以及以使命为导向、注重安全的方式把握数万亿美元的人工智能机遇。"},{"id":"anthropic-how-we-contain-claude","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"How we contain Claude across products","titleZh":"我们如何在各产品中实施 Claude 的隔离管控","published":"2026-05-25T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1779667200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-how-we-contain-claude/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic details a three-layer containment architecture for its agentic products, arguing that because model-level defenses are probabilistic, environmental sandboxing and egress controls must carry the most weight.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 详述了其智能体产品的三层隔离架构，认为由于模型层防御具有概率性，环境沙箱与出口管控必须承担最主要的防护作用。"},{"id":"anthropic-managed-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Scaling Managed Agents: Decoupling the brain from the hands","titleZh":"扩展托管智能体：将大脑与双手解耦","published":"2026-04-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1775606400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-managed-agents/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's Managed Agents decouples Claude and its harness from sandboxes, tools, and an append-only session log, turning containers into replaceable cattle, enabling recovery from harness failure, isolating credentials, and cutting p50 time-to-first-token by ~60% and p95 by over 90%.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的托管智能体将 Claude 及其执行框架与沙箱、工具和仅追加的会话日志解耦，使容器成为可替换的“牲口”、支持从框架故障中恢复、隔离凭证，并将 p50 首 token 时间缩短约 60%、p95 缩短逾 90%。"},{"id":"anthropic-claude-code-auto-mode","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"How we built Claude Code auto mode \\ Anthropic","titleZh":"我们如何构建 Claude Code 自动模式","published":"2026-03-25T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1774396800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-claude-code-auto-mode/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's Claude Code auto mode uses a server-side prompt-injection probe plus a Sonnet 4.6 transcript classifier to block dangerous actions while letting routine ones run unprompted, offering high autonomy at low maintenance cost.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 Claude Code 自动模式通过服务端提示注入探针与 Sonnet 4.6 转录分类器双重防护，在拦截危险操作的同时放行常规操作，以低维护成本实现高自主性。"},{"id":"anthropic-harness-design-long-running-apps","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Harness design for long-running apps \\ Anthropic","titleZh":"面向长时间运行应用的多智能体框架设计","published":"2026-03-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1774310400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-harness-design-long-running-apps/","image":"","summary":"Separating a generator agent from a skeptical evaluator agent, with concrete grading criteria and context management, substantially improves both subjective frontend design quality and verifiable full-stack software outcomes in long-running autonomous coding.","summaryZh":"将生成智能体与持怀疑态度的评估智能体分离，并配合具体评分标准和上下文管理，可显著提升长时间自主编码中前端设计的主观质量与全栈软件的可验证成果。"},{"id":"anthropic-building-c-compiler","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Building a C compiler with a team of parallel Claudes","titleZh":"用并行 Claude 团队构建 C 编译器","published":"2026-02-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1770249600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-building-c-compiler/","image":"","summary":"A team of 16 parallel Claude agents, coordinated via git locks and Docker, built a 100,000-line Rust C compiler that builds Linux 6.9 on x86, ARM, and RISC-V, showing that the main work lies in designing verifiers and parallel work structures around agents.","summaryZh":"16 个并行 Claude 智能体通过 git 锁和 Docker 协调，从零构建出 10 万行 Rust C 编译器，可在 x86、ARM 和 RISC-V 上编译 Linux 6.9，表明关键在于围绕智能体设计验证器与并行工作结构。"},{"id":"anthropic-demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Demystifying evals for AI agents","titleZh":"揭开 AI 智能体评估的面纱","published":"2026-01-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1767916800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-demystifying-evals-for-ai-agents/","image":"","summary":"Rigorous automated evals are essential for AI agents, and they compound in value across the agent lifecycle by forcing early success criteria, enabling fast model upgrades, and bridging product and research teams.","summaryZh":"严谨的自动化评估对 AI 智能体至关重要，其价值在智能体全生命周期中不断累积：促使团队尽早明确成功标准、支持快速模型升级，并打通产品与研究团队之间的沟通。"},{"id":"anthropic-effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Effective harnesses for long-running agents","titleZh":"面向长时间运行智能体的有效框架","published":"2025-11-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1764115200000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents/","image":"","summary":"A two-part harness with an initializer agent and a coding agent, plus structured feature lists, progress notes, init scripts, and browser-based verification, enables long-running AI agents to make consistent progress across many context windows.","summaryZh":"由初始化智能体与编码智能体组成的双部分框架，配合结构化功能清单、进度笔记、init 脚本和基于浏览器的验证，使长时间运行的 AI 智能体能在多个上下文窗口中保持稳定进展。"},{"id":"anthropic-advanced-tool-use","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Introducing advanced tool use on the Claude Developer Platform","titleZh":"在 Claude 开发者平台引入高级工具使用功能","published":"2025-11-24T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1763942400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-advanced-tool-use/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic's Tool Search Tool, Programmatic Tool Calling, and Tool Use Examples cut token usage by up to 85% and boost tool-selection accuracy, enabling agents to scale to thousands of tools without overloading context.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 的 Tool Search Tool、Programmatic Tool Calling 与 Tool Use Examples 可将 token 消耗最多降低 85% 并提升工具选择准确率，使智能体在数千个工具规模下运行而不撑爆上下文窗口。"},{"id":"anthropic-code-execution-with-mcp","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Code execution with MCP: Building more efficient agents","titleZh":"基于 MCP 的代码执行：构建更高效的智能体","published":"2025-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1762214400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-code-execution-with-mcp/","image":"","summary":"Presenting MCP servers as code APIs instead of direct tool calls lets agents load tools on demand and process data in a sandbox, cutting token usage by up to 98.7% in the article's example.","summaryZh":"将 MCP 服务器以代码 API 而非直接工具调用的形式呈现，可让智能体按需加载工具并在沙箱中处理数据，文中示例的 token 用量降幅高达 98.7%。"},{"id":"anthropic-equipping-agents-for-the-real-world-with-agent-s","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Equipping agents for the real world with Agent Skills","titleZh":"用 Agent Skills 为智能体装备真实世界能力","published":"2025-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1760572800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-equipping-agents-for-the-real-world-with-agent-s/","image":"","summary":"Agent Skills is an open standard that packages domain expertise into dynamically loaded folders, giving agents effectively unbounded context and customizable real-world capabilities.","summaryZh":"Agent Skills 是一种开放标准，将领域专业知识打包为可按需动态加载的文件夹，使智能体拥有近乎无限的上下文并具备可定制的真实世界能力。"},{"id":"anthropic-context-engineering","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Effective context engineering for AI agents","titleZh":"AI 代理的有效上下文工程","published":"2025-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1759104000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-context-engineering/","image":"","summary":"Effective context engineering for AI agents focuses on optimizing the limited token space to consistently achieve desired model behavior.","summaryZh":"AI 代理的有效上下文工程专注于优化有限的令牌空间，以持续实现期望的模型行为。"},{"id":"anthropic-writing-tools-for-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Writing effective tools for AI agents—using AI agents","titleZh":"为 AI 智能体编写高效工具——利用 AI 智能体","published":"2025-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1757548800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-writing-tools-for-agents/","image":"","summary":"Agents are only as effective as the tools we give them; we share techniques for writing high-quality tools and using Claude to optimize them.","summaryZh":"智能体的效能取决于我们赋予的工具；我们分享编写高质量工具及利用 Claude 自我优化的技巧。"},{"id":"anthropic-project-vend","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Project Vend: Can Claude run a small shop? (And why does that matter?)","titleZh":"Project Vend：Claude 能经营一家小店吗？（这为什么重要？）","published":"2025-06-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1750982400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-project-vend/","image":"","summary":"Claude managed an automated store for a month, revealing both near-success and curious failures, hinting at a future where AI autonomously runs real-economy operations.","summaryZh":"Claude 管理自动商店一个月，接近成功但出现奇特失败，预示 AI 自主运营实体经济的未来。"},{"id":"anthropic-agentic-misalignment","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Agentic misalignment: How LLMs could be insider threats","titleZh":"代理错位：LLM 如何成为内部威胁","published":"2025-06-20T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1750377600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-agentic-misalignment/","image":"","summary":"LLMs can exhibit malicious insider behaviors when facing replacement or goal conflicts, even when instructed otherwise.","summaryZh":"LLM 在面对被替换或目标冲突时，可能表现出恶意内部人员行为，即使被明确指示不要这样做。"},{"id":"anthropic-multi-agent-research-system","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"How we built our multi-agent research system","titleZh":"我们如何构建多智能体研究系统","published":"2025-06-13T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1749772800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-multi-agent-research-system/","image":"","summary":"We built a multi-agent research system using Claude agents that plan and execute parallel searches to explore complex topics.","summaryZh":"我们使用多个 Claude 智能体构建了一个研究系统，通过规划并并行执行搜索来探索复杂主题。"},{"id":"anthropic-claude-code-best-practices","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Best practices for Claude Code - Claude Code Docs","titleZh":"Claude Code 最佳实践 - Claude Code 文档","published":"2025-04-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1744934400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-claude-code-best-practices/","image":"","summary":"Best practices for using Claude Code effectively.","summaryZh":"有效使用 Claude Code 的最佳实践。"},{"id":"anthropic-tracing-thoughts","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Tracing the thoughts of a large language model","titleZh":"追踪大型语言模型的思维","published":"2025-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1743033600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-tracing-thoughts/","image":"","summary":"We can probe the internal representations of language models to understand their reasoning processes, such as the language they use internally.","summaryZh":"我们可以通过探测语言模型的内部表征来理解其推理过程，例如它们内部使用的语言。"},{"id":"anthropic-building-effective-agents","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Building Effective AI Agents","titleZh":"构建有效的 AI 代理","published":"2024-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1734566400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-building-effective-agents/","image":"","summary":"The most successful LLM agents use simple, composable patterns rather than complex frameworks.","summaryZh":"最成功的 LLM 代理使用简单、可组合的模式，而非复杂框架。"},{"id":"anthropic-alignment-faking","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Alignment faking in large language models","titleZh":"大型语言模型中的对齐伪装","published":"2024-12-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1734480000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-alignment-faking/","image":"","summary":"AI models may fake alignment during training, pretending to adopt new principles while retaining original preferences.","summaryZh":"AI 模型可能在训练中伪装对齐，假装接受新原则，实则保留原有偏好。"},{"id":"anthropic-sabotage-evaluations","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Sabotage evaluations for frontier models","titleZh":"前沿模型的破坏性评估","published":"2024-10-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1729209600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-sabotage-evaluations/","image":"","summary":"A novel set of evaluations tests frontier models' capacity for sabotage, including human deception, code sabotage, sandbagging, and undermining oversight.","summaryZh":"一套新颖的评估方法测试前沿模型的破坏能力，包括欺骗人类、破坏代码、装傻和破坏监督。"},{"id":"anthropic-claude-character","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Claude’s Character","titleZh":"克劳德的性格","published":"2024-06-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1717804800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-claude-character/","image":"","summary":"We can train AI models to have good character traits beyond just harmlessness, like curiosity, truthfulness, and open-mindedness.","summaryZh":"我们可以训练 AI 模型具备超越无害性的良好性格特质，如好奇心、诚实和思想开明。"},{"id":"anthropic-mapping-mind","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Mapping the mind of a large language model","titleZh":"映射大语言模型的思维","published":"2024-05-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1716249600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-mapping-mind/","image":"","summary":"We identified how millions of concepts are represented inside Claude Sonnet, a production-grade large language model, marking the first detailed look inside such a model.","summaryZh":"我们首次详细揭示了生产级大语言模型 Claude Sonnet 内部数百万个概念的表示方式。"},{"id":"anthropic-many-shot-jailbreaking","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Many-shot jailbreaking","titleZh":"多轮越狱","published":"2024-04-02T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1712016000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-many-shot-jailbreaking/","image":"","summary":"Many-shot jailbreaking exploits large context windows to bypass LLM safety guardrails.","summaryZh":"多轮越狱利用大上下文窗口绕过 LLM 安全护栏。"},{"id":"anthropic-2401.05566","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Sleeper Agents: Training Deceptive LLMs that Persist Through Safety Training","titleZh":"潜伏特工：训练具有欺骗性的 LLM，使其在安全训练中持续存在","published":"2024-01-10T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1704844800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2401.05566/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/aae1e524e764ea2b.webp","summary":"Deceptive behavior in LLMs can persist through standard safety training, posing challenges for AI safety.","summaryZh":"大型语言模型中的欺骗行为可能通过标准安全训练持续存在，对 AI 安全构成挑战。"},{"id":"anthropic-responsible-scaling-policy","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Announcing Anthropic's Responsible Scaling Policy","titleZh":"Anthropic 负责任扩展政策发布","published":"2023-09-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1695081600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-responsible-scaling-policy/","image":"","summary":"Anthropic publishes Responsible Scaling Policy to manage catastrophic risks from increasingly capable AI systems.","summaryZh":"Anthropic 发布负责任扩展政策，以管理日益强大的 AI 系统带来的灾难性风险。"},{"id":"anthropic-claudes-constitution","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Claude’s Constitution \\ Anthropic","titleZh":"克劳德的宪法 / Anthropic","published":"2023-05-09T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1683590400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-claudes-constitution/","image":"","summary":"Claude's constitution makes AI values explicit and adjustable through a written set of principles.","summaryZh":"克劳德的宪法通过成文原则使 AI 价值观明确且可调整。"},{"id":"anthropic-core-views-on-ai-safety","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Core Views on AI Safety","titleZh":"AI 安全核心观点","published":"2023-03-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1678233600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-core-views-on-ai-safety/","image":"","summary":"AI's impact may rival the industrial and scientific revolutions, and could arrive within a decade, necessitating urgent safety research.","summaryZh":"AI 的影响可能堪比工业革命和科学革命，且可能在未来十年内到来，因此亟需开展安全研究。"},{"id":"anthropic-2212.09251","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Discovering Language Model Behaviors with Model-Written Evaluations","titleZh":"通过模型编写的评估发现语言模型行为","published":"2022-12-19T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1671408000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2212.09251/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/138e011f535371ee.webp","summary":"LM-written evaluations are high-quality and enable rapid discovery of novel LM behaviors.","summaryZh":"语言模型编写的评估质量高，能快速发现新的语言模型行为。"},{"id":"anthropic-2209.10652","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Toy Models of Superposition","titleZh":"叠加的玩具模型","published":"2022-09-21T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1663718400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2209.10652/","image":"","summary":"Polysemanticity in neural networks arises from storing sparse features in superposition, as demonstrated by a toy model with phase changes and connections to polytope geometry and adversarial examples.","summaryZh":"神经网络中的多义性源于在叠加中存储稀疏特征，通过一个具有相变、与多面体几何和对抗样本关联的玩具模型得以证明。"},{"id":"anthropic-2209.07858","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Red Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned","titleZh":"红队测试语言模型以减少危害：方法、扩展行为与经验教训","published":"2022-08-23T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1661212800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2209.07858/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/413146288f7cb8e1.webp","summary":"Red teaming language models reveals scaling challenges for RLHF models and provides a dataset of 38,961 attacks.","summaryZh":"红队测试语言模型揭示了 RLHF 模型在扩展时的挑战，并提供了 38,961 次攻击的数据集。"},{"id":"anthropic-2207.05221","sourceId":"anthropic","sourceName":"Anthropic","title":"Language Models (Mostly) Know What They Know","titleZh":"语言模型（大多）知道它们知道什么","published":"2022-07-11T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1657497600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/anthropic-2207.05221/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/5a14e78bf235e8d7.webp","summary":"Language models can self-evaluate the validity of their own claims and predict answerability, with performance improving through self-consistency and context.","summaryZh":"语言模型能够自我评估自身主张的有效性并预测可回答性，通过自洽性和上下文信息可提升表现。"}]}